# Debt Tracker System Architecture

## Purpose
A personal application to track money owed by friends when the owner pays for shared expenses.

Example:
- Owner pays for dinner
- Friends owe their share
- Friends later repay the owner

The system records expenses and payments and dynamically calculates balances.

