# Example Flow

Owner pays ₹900 for dinner with Rahul and Aman.

Expense created:
₹900 dinner

Participants:
Rahul owes ₹450
Aman owes ₹450

Later Rahul pays ₹200.

Remaining balance:
Rahul owes ₹250
Aman owes ₹450